ord’s ♠A with the minimal necessary upgrade (♣2) to preserve the powerful BlackJoker for future critical moments, while taking control of the turn. This increases the chance that I can manage the flow of the game and support my teammate who is down to only 2 cards.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣2"]}'}
